    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to fire from the optimal position, using the ground to steady your aim.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Careful_Shot\" title=\"Careful Shot\">Careful Shot</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aim\" title=\"Aim\">Aim</a> before making a ranged attack, your target does not benefit from its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus to its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>.</p>",
